{"role":"assistant","content":"Fixed the two confirmed causes:\n\n- `Library/LaunchAgents/com.vk.nightly-review.plist`: added `USER=vk`, resolving the agent’s `Not logged in` failure.\n- `bin/nightly-review.zsh`: replaced zsh’s read-only `status` variable with `rc`, allowing failure notifications to run.\n\nThe job had run six times; authentication failed each time, then the `status=$?` assignment killed the script before it could notify you.\n\n`ANSWER.md` documents the causes, applicable parts of the note, and verification. Plist/syntax checks passed, and isolated end-to-end tests confirmed both success and failure notifications. No external services were contacted. Reload the plist in the real home directory to activate the environment change."}
